DSMmodule::constructor
├── when passing valid DSM address with valid hat
│   └── it deploys and sets DSM variable
└── when passing DSM address with invalid hat
    └── it reverts with NotActive


DSMmodule::onlyAdmin
├── when DSM executable returns true
│   └── it allows execution
├── when DSM executable returns false
│   └── it reverts with NotAuthorized
└── when DSM executable reverts
    ├── when contract not registered
    │   └── it reverts with NotRegistered
    └── when caller not authorized
        └── it reverts with NotAuthorized


DSMmodule::DSM
└── when called
    └── it returns the correct DSM contract address
